    "text": "By James Pilcher, WKRC ,\n8 hours ago CINCINNATI (WKRC) - Cory Bowman, the Republican candidate for Cincinnati mayor and half-brother of Vice President JD Vance, co-owns a business that faced actions from the state of Ohio in 2024 and in early 2025 for non-payment of sales taxes. Bowman co-owns Kings Arms Coffee Shop in the West End,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
